  "provenance": "All six arms measure d62417f1, the #840 firmware on dev 604899c0: on a PHY reporting 1000BASE-T full duplex ability the PHY init advertises that mode only and restarts auto-negotiation once, and the configs carry the locally administered station MACs 02:4B:4C:00:00:01 and 02:4B:4C:00:00:02. The capture harness now addresses its controller traffic to the configured station MAC and its MAC-derived entity_id. nvm_capture() and the census are unchanged, and so is the RTL. Processor pins a9e84b66 (protocol) and 135afd04 (gPTP). 23 of 96 captures repeat the previous receipt's system-cycle counts (c71364bd). The six arms ran in five drivers side by side, the two 1x1 arms in one. The capture SoC has no Milan MAC MDIO CSR, so the PHY path is compiled out. ARM through ATTEST contains no heartbeat or PHY call.",
